  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_016's multimodal approach achieves moderate performance (52.66% accuracy), but there is no comparison to unimodal baselines. This experiment will test a unimodal RNA-only model using the same RNA encoder (pca_n2000) as config_016, isolating the impact of adding image modality. By comparing this baseline to the multimodal result, we can determine if multimodal approaches provide meaningful performance gains. This addresses critical uncertainty about the value of multimodal fusion and encoder choices while maintaining alignment with the primary optimization objective of validation accuracy."
